For the wear of the crawler traveling mechanism, the following measures can be taken:
In order to extend the service life, the front and rear track rollers can be exchanged, but the original position of the single and bilateral rollers on the undercarriage frame must be kept unchanged;
After the parts of the undercarriage are worn to the limit of use, the idlers, track rollers, rollers, sprocket segment group, thorns, and chain rails can be repaired or replaced by surfacing welding;
For the situation that the pitch of the track chain becomes longer due to wear and tear, it can be remedied by reversing the track section or replace the new track section.
