as an outdoor advertising LED display, its use environment is much higher than the requirements of general display.
In order to make the display screen safe and reliable in bad weather, we must take preventive measures to ensure its safe operation.
The outdoor LED display screen usually has a large area, which consumes a lot of power in the application process, and the corresponding heat dissipation is also large.
If the heat dissipation problem cannot be solved in time, it may lead to problems such as circuit board heating and short circuit.
As far as possible, the hollow design is selected in the shell design, which is conducive to heat dissipation.
When necessary, heat dissipation equipment shall be installed on the display screen, just like installing air conditioners or fans inside to help the display screen heat dissipation.
Therefore, in the typhoon season, in order to prevent the outdoor LED display screen from falling off, there are strict requirements for the load-bearing steel frame structure of the display.
