Research has consistently supported the benefits of practicing gratitude in enhancing well-being.
This is a way to practice gratitude regularly, at any time, in the midst of whatever circumstances we find ourselves. Many of us have heard the old adage “count your blessings;” proactive gratitude is essentially that.
