Tube Filling and Sealing Machine is designed for Al tube, plastic tube and laminated tube filling and sealing for cosmetic, pharmacy, foodstuff and bond industries. Its working principle is:
The material filling is in the fourth station and then come to the sealing(and tail bending) station for heating (PE tube) folding (metal tube), tail sealing (PE), clamping (metal), batch number printing, cooling, cutting and at last finished products discharging. Every tube should go through the whole procedure and then finished after filling and sealing.
